BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eight Step Recovery Group for Men
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T183000
UID:6bc52371b0b9217867c950ec@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Eight Step Recovery is an alternative recovery program to the 
 12-Step program of Alcoholic Anonymous. The program is a set of mindfulnes
 s teachings outlining a suggested course of action for recovery from addic
 tion\, stinking thinking\, negative mental states\, and compulsive and obs
 essive behaviours.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/eight-step-recovery-for-
 men-4-jun
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindfulness for Stress
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T213000
UID:c4b1f07b36e7a50ba907a509@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This eight-week evidence-based course is designed to help you 
 manage stress and overwhelm in your life. This course teaches practical mi
 ndfulness tools to reduce stress\, calm anxiety\, and bring balance to dai
 ly life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-for-stress-j
 un-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Class: Meditation & In-Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T211500
UID:011c9ef79e9fe75adccdcd78@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The Noble Eightfold Path is one of the Buddha's most complete 
 and practical guides to living a life that leads to liberation. Over eight
  weeks\, we will explore each step of the path\, drawing on Bhante Urgyen 
 Sangharakshita's seminal lecture series as our guide.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/thurs-night-4-jun
END:VEVENT
